"""Module docstring with a summary line that goes on past the comment width of one
hundred and twenty characters, ok.

A second paragraph that is short.
"""

# The cache keeps one entry per manifest, keyed by path and modification time, because
# parsing a manifest dominates the start-up time of large projects and their
# configuration files are many, so it is kept.
